---
import { introPainCards } from '../data/content';
---

<div id="intro">
  <div class="layer scene-bg"></div>
  <div class="layer shapes" id="shapes"></div>
  <div class="layer panel pain">
    <h2>Muchas empresas invierten en marketing digital sin claridad sobre qué <span class="grad-pink">genera resultados:</span></h2>
    <div class="paincards">
      {introPainCards.map((text) => (
        <div class="pcard2"><span class="o"></span>{text}</div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="layer panel result">
    <h2>El resultado: <span class="grad-pink">inversión dispersa y bajo retorno.</span></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="layer cover-bg"></div>
  <div class="layer cover-fx" id="coverFx"></div>
  <div class="layer cover-ct">
    <div class="tagline">Marketing diseñado para crecer<br>con data y tecnología</div>
    <div class="logo">
      <img class="logo-img logo-anim" src="/images/logos/fadlatam_logo_full_1.webp" alt="FAD LATAM" width="1514" height="494" decoding="async" />
    </div>
    <div class="baseline"></div>
  </div>

  <div id="portal" aria-hidden="true">
    <video
      id="intro-video"
      class="portal-video"
      src="/video/FAD_LATAM_WordFlash_vf.mp4"
      playsinline
      preload="auto"
      loop
      muted
      autoplay
    ></video>
  </div>
</div>
